        {
          "text": "Umuntu w’ikivyarwa ntaz’ agere mw ikoraniro ry’Uhoraho; haba n’uwo mu ruvyaro rwiwe azorigeramwo, eka mber’ uko bazogenda bavyarana gushitsa no ku bihe cumi.",
