        },
        {
          "text": "Ntihaze hagire Umwamoni cank’ Umunyamowabu agera mw ikoraniro ry’Uhoraho; haba n’ uwo mu runganwe rwabo azorigeramwo, eka mber’ uko ruzogenda rukurikirana gushitsa icumi; ",
          "type": "text",
