              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntihaze hagire ūjana mu ngoro y’Uhoraho Imana yanyu ibihērewe maraya, cank’ ibihērewe umugabo yendwa, ngw abishikishe isezerano iry’ ari ryo ryose: kukw ivyo vyompi ar’ ubuyobe k’Uhoraho Imana yanyu.",
